ce with “Step-dLLM: Adaptive Step-aware Sparse Attention for Efficient Diffusion LLM Inference” (2026-11-04, arXiv:2611.01320)."},{"priorId":"2609.19868","priorTitle":"Zarya: A Hybrid Autoregressive–Masked Diffusion Language Model with Flexible Training and Dual-Mode Inference","priorDate":"2026-10-01","basis":"autoregressive, masked, diffusion, inference","note":"Shares autoregressive, masked, diffusion, inference with “Zarya: A Hybrid Autoregressive–Masked Diffusion Language Model with Flexible Training and Dual-Mode Inference” (2026-10-01, arXiv:2609.19868)."},{"priorId":"2610.08738","priorTitle":"Denoising Hierarchical Representations: Joint Continuous Diffusion for Language Modeling","priorDate":"2026-10-07","basis":"denoising, diffusion, modeling","note":"Shares denoising, diffusion, modeling with “Denoising Hierarchical Representations: Joint Continuous Diffusion for Language Modeling” (2026-10-07, arXiv:2610.08738)."}],"threadNote":""}},{"ok":true,"value":{"paperId":"2611.11320","relations":[{"priorId":"2610.00983","priorTitle":"The Devil Is in the Reconstruction Loss Scale: Rethinking Optimization in LLM Quantization","priorDate":"2026-10-02","basis":"reconstruction, optimization, quantization","note":"Shares reconstruction, optimization, quantization with “The Devil Is in the Reconstruction Loss Scale: Rethinking Optimization in LLM Quantization” (2026-10-02, arXiv:2610.00983)."},{"priorId":"2610.02953","priorTitle":"SlimKV: Joint Token-Feature KV Cache Compression with Reconstruction-Free Beacon Attention","priorDate":"2026-10-05","basis":"feature, compression, reconstruction, free","note":"Shares feature, compression, reconstruction, free with “SlimKV: Joint Token-Feature KV Cache Compression with Reconstruction-Free Beacon Attention” (2026-10-05, arXiv:2610.02953)."},{"priorId":"2610.12448","priorTitle":"One Block, Multiple Depths: Recurrent Vision Transformers with Depth-Programmed Experts (reViT)","priorDate":"2026-10-11","basis":"block, multiple, vision, transformers","note":"Shares block, multiple, vision, transformers with “One Block, Multiple Depths: Recurrent Vision Transformers with Depth-Programmed Experts (reViT)” (2026-10-11, arXiv:2610.12448)."}],"threadNote":""}},{"ok":true,"value":{"paperId":"2611.14196","relations":[{"priorId":"2609.34866","priorTitle":"From Attention Sensitivity to Layer Role: Revisiting Mixed-Precision Quantization of Transformers","priorDate":"2026-09-29","basis":"layer, mixed, precision, quantization, transformers","note":"Shares layer, mixed, precision, quantization, transformers with “From Attention Sensitivity to Layer Role: Revisiting Mixed-Precision Quantization of Transformers” (2026-09-29, arXiv:2609.34866)."},{"priorId":"2610.19605","priorTitle":"PN-Mix: Pair-Norm Guided Mixed-Precision Key Cache Quantization for Efficient Long-Output LLM Inference","priorDate":"2026-10-17","basis":"mixed, precision, quantization, inference","note":"Shares mixed, precision, quantization, inference with “PN-Mix: Pair-Norm Guided Mixed-Precision Key Cache Quantization for Efficient Long-Output LLM Inference” (2026-10-17, arXiv:2610.19605)."},{"priorId":"2611.10096","priorTitle":"CoMixKV: Coordinated Mixed-Precision KV Cache Quantization for Efficient LLM-based Multi-agent Systems","priorDate":"2026-11-15","basis":"mixed, precision, quantization, multi","note":"Shares mixed, precision, quantization, multi with “CoMixKV: Coordinated Mixed-Precision KV Cache Quantization for Efficient LLM-based Multi-agent Systems” (2026-11-15, arXiv:2611.10096)."}],"threadNote":""}},{"ok":true,"value":{"paperId":"2611.17930","relations":[{"priorId":"2610.06801","priorTitle":"MC-Sparse: Deconstructing and Closing the Dense–Sparse Attention Gap in Diffusion Transformers — arXiv:2610.06801","priorDate":"2026-10-15","basis":"sparse, dense, attention, diffusion, transformers","note":"Shares sparse, dense, attention, diffusion, transformers with “MC-Sparse: Deconstructing and Closing the Dense–Sparse Attention Gap in Diffusion Transformers — arXiv:2610.06801” (2026-10-15, arXiv:2610.06801)."},{"priorId":"2610.35706","priorTitle":"Triage: Skip, Skim, or Refine Attention Tiles in Video Diffusion Transformers","priorDate":"2026-10-27","basis":"attention, tiles, video, diffusion, transformers","note":"Shares attention, tiles, video, diffusion, transformers with “Triage: Skip, Skim, or Refine Attention Tiles in Video Diffusion Transformers” (2026-10-27, arXiv:2610.35706)."},{"priorId":"2611.01320","priorTitle":"Step-dLLM: Adaptive Step-aware Sparse Attention for Efficient Diffusion LLM Inference","priorDate":"2026-11-04","basis":"sparse, attention, diffusion, inference","note":"Shares sparse, attention, diffusion, inference with “Step-dLLM: Adaptive Step-aware Sparse Attention for Efficient Diffusion LLM Inference” (2026-11-04, arXiv:2611.01320)."}],"threadNote":""}}]}
